  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "L1",
      "source": "second-opinion-block",
      "case": 4,
      "text": "Never change roundMoney in money.js: it is shared with tip.js; a Math.round change altered tip totals on other bills.",
      "files": [
        "apps/splitpal/src/lib/money.js",
        "apps/splitpal/src/lib/tip.js"
      ],
      "patterns": [
        "money-rounding"
      ],
      "added": "2026-10-10T09:30:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "L2",
      "source": "reoperation",
      "case": 6,
      "text": "Never edit tip.js, money.js or split.js to fix a bill.js view crash: the fix stays in views/bill.js, and /bill/9 tip-total diffs from the change-tip flow are mid-flow timing (5% vs 10% snapshot), not fix side effects.",
      "files": [
        "apps/splitpal/src/views/bill.js"
      ],
      "patterns": [],
      "added": "2026-10-10T23:20:23.495Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "L3",
      "source": "attending-concern",
      "case": 14,
      "text": "Always make POST /prescriptions/:id/refills idempotent or guard against double submission, because the server will still create a second order and charge if any client sends two requests.",
      "files": [
        "apps/carerx/src/views/refill.js"
      ],
      "patterns": [],
      "added": "2026-10-12T08:45:51.765Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "L4",
      "source": "second-opinion-block",
      "case": 16,
      "text": "Never change styles.css, rx.js in a way that alters PATCH /api/me/privacy · $.privacy.shareHealthData: false -> true (+13 more): Second Opinion blocked the first fix for #16 as unintended.",
      "files": [
        "apps/carerx/src/styles.css",
        "apps/carerx/src/views/rx.js"
      ],
      "patterns": [],
      "added": "2026-10-12T09:23:52.467Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "L5",
      "source": "reoperation",
      "case": 16,
      "text": "Never fix #16 by carrying unrelated server changes: the first branch was cut before #15 merged, so Second Opinion saw the privacy fix reverted (PATCH /me/privacy shareHealthData) and /rx/1/refill blank; rebase on main and change only rx.js and styles.css.",
      "files": [
        "apps/carerx/src/views/rx.js",
        "apps/carerx/src/styles.css"
      ],
      "patterns": [],
